1
00:00:00,726 --> 00:00:02,066
(Sheldon:)Um...

2
00:00:02,261 --> 00:00:07,011
(Sheldon:)In a hundred years, you'll both
be dead and it won't matter?

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:11,910
No! Come on! You're supposed to say,
"Of course he misses you.

4
00:00:12,070 --> 00:00:14,810
(Penny:)The only reason he's partying
is to cover up his pain."

5
00:00:14,973 --> 00:00:17,423
(Sheldon:)Oh, no, I don't think
that's true at all.

6
00:00:20,178 --> 00:00:21,418
(Penny:)This is ridiculous.

7
00:00:21,580 --> 00:00:23,960
(Penny:)Why am I upset just because
he's off having a good time?

8
00:00:24,116 --> 00:00:28,686
(Sheldon:)Well, perhaps you're
obsessively picturing him

9
00:00:28,854 --> 00:00:32,324
(Sheldon:)engaged in drunken coitus
with another woman.

10
00:00:35,827 --> 00:00:38,367
(Sheldon:)Is that it?
Did I get it right?

11
00:00:40,599 --> 00:00:43,339
Okay, that's great. You can stop
trying to make me feel better now.

12
00:00:43,502 --> 00:00:45,042
(Sheldon:)Actually, I can't.

13
00:00:45,203 --> 00:00:48,553
(Sheldon:)Before Leonard left, he made me
promise that I'd take care of you.

14
00:00:48,707 --> 00:00:51,157
(Penny:)-He did?
-Yes.

15
00:00:51,310 --> 00:00:53,720
Oh! That's really sweet.

16
00:00:53,879 --> 00:01:00,019
(Sheldon:)Plus, if I do a good job, he said
he'd bring me back a sailor's cap.

